OL,3,ASix killed in Krakow 'far-right'
OL,4,Ashooting, as three more bodies found in
OL,5,Asuspect's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmong the 16 injured are five foreign
OL,8,Fnationals from Austria, Germany,
OL,9,FPortugal, Russia and Britain.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
